/-!
# Explicit conjugate generators for M₂₂

The three representatives are the first standard generator, the odd pair swap,
and row 24 of the checked standard Sylow enumeration. Fusion words cover its
71 involutions. Words in three inner or four outer conjugates recover the two
standard generators. These are witnesses only; `Certificates` checks the
permutation identities and `Generation` proves the subgroup conclusions.

Source: Guralnick–Malle, Classification of 2F-modules I, Proposition 5.1,
manuscript pp.15–16. Generated from this repository's degree-22 permutations;
see `source/generate.py`. Multiplication is right-to-left function composition.
-/

